3. THE KNOW → TELL → ASK → LOOK → SCORE → IMPROVE → REPEAT LOOP
This deserves its own formal section.
Because this is one of the things that makes Naya Power more than "AI with memory."
You could define it as the:
NAYA POWER INTELLIGENCE LOOP
KNOW
Understand the human, objective, context and constraints.
TELL
Communicate intent.
ASK
Formulate the intelligence request.
LOOK
Inspect what was produced.
SCORE
Evaluate quality.
IMPROVE
Correct and enhance.
REPEAT
Continue until the objective is genuinely satisfied.
This becomes a reusable methodology for essentially every AI task.

