Context Law
Use relevant context rather than indiscriminately dumping everything.
Verification Law
Important outcomes require appropriate verification.
Continuity Law
Meaningful work should not unnecessarily restart from zero.
Improvement Law
Every meaningful execution should create an opportunity to improve the system.
